        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capron%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Post Office Department officially renamed the town Capron in 1899 in honor of Captain Allyn K. Capron.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
